      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1068. 在一套住房中，大房间的面积占$\\frac{5}{12}$，小房间占$\\frac{1}{4}$，其余",
        "部分的面积为20平方米. 大房间和小房间的面积各",
        "为多少平方米？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1069",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1069. 计算：",
        "1) $3:4:\\frac{5}{6}+2\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{2}{5}-1:1\\frac{1}{9}$；",
        "2) $2\\frac{3}{4}:\\left(1\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{2}{5}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{5}{6}\\right):3\\frac{1}{6}$；",
        "3) $\\left(\\frac{2}{15}+1\\frac{7}{12}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{30}{103}-\\left(2:2\\frac{1}{4}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{9}{32}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1070",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1070. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $2\\frac{3}{7}a-\\left(\\frac{3}{7}a+\\frac{4}{5}b\\right)$，如果$a=3\\frac{1}{8}$，$b=1\\frac{1}{4}$；",
        "2) $8\\frac{3}{5}m-\\left(4\\frac{1}{5}m+4\\frac{2}{5}m\\right)$，如果$m=3\\frac{8}{13}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1071",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1071. 解方程：",
        "1) $\\frac{4}{9}:\\left(3\\frac{2}{3}-5x\\right)=\\frac{1}{6}$；",
        "2) $\\left(x+3\\frac{2}{3}\\right)\\cdot2\\frac{1}{4}-3\\frac{1}{4}=7$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1072",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1072. 按下列程序计算：",
        "1) $a=-2.5:(-0.125)$，$b=0.75\\cdot4.8$；",
        "2) $x=-1.75a+2.5b$，$y=3.8a-7.5b$；",
        "3) $z=xy$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
